"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここは, 桑田クンの部屋だ.
#. 今は, ここに用はない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is Leon's room. I don't really have anything to\n"
